	(text "Freeze Rev A: TPS63031 fixed 3.3V typical (1.5uH, 10uF in, 2x10uF out, 0.1uF VINA); TPS7A2030 fixed 3.0V (1uF in/out); buffer OE tied GND, no PWR_GOOD divider (Audit 1: 1.5V violates VIH/VIL; Ioff isolates at VCC=0). Budget: POWER_BUDGET.md."
